\description{
Plan and track technology, manufacturing and funding readiness levels (TRL, MRL, FRL and any other track) on one timeline. Milestones are stored in a plain CSV file, can depend on several other milestones with a lag in months (the longest dependency decides the date), and are shown as an interactive timeline with quarterly ticks and hover comments. A 'shiny' app lets you move milestones by dragging, and a standalone HTML snapshot of the current status can be exported.
